      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YARRAMUNDI DOLLY (7) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 1.75 lengths (17.88) behind Kookaburra Bear at Murray Bridge. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Likely to feature again. KICK TO KICK (1) is still a maiden after nine runs but rarely far away, the latest filling a minor placing when second at this track. Well-placed to take this out. LASH ATTACK (5) is yet to break through in 12 starts but has run a number of placings. Was in the placings again last time finishing third (17.93) at this track. Leading player again. ALL I ASK (3) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
